191
00:11:56,196 --> 00:11:59,616
Ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha!

192
00:11:59,616 --> 00:12:03,136
That's right.

193
00:12:03,576 --> 00:12:08,156
You're looking at the champion on a South Blue Island renowned for its martial arts.

194
00:12:08,656 --> 00:12:11,756
The undefeated boxing champion!

195
00:12:12,096 --> 00:12:13,036
I prefer karate.

196
00:12:13,036 --> 00:12:19,516
If you can handle my punches, then maybe I'll show you some.

197
00:12:21,036 --> 00:12:21,576
Ah!

198
00:12:21,576 --> 00:12:22,056
Easy!

199
00:12:22,196 --> 00:12:23,516
