214
00:12:55,236 --> 00:12:56,976
You just shortened your reach!

215
00:12:57,176 --> 00:12:58,336
That's what you think.

216
00:12:58,336 --> 00:12:59,556
All part of the band!

217
00:13:01,936 --> 00:13:03,016
BROCKY!

218
00:13:04,296 --> 00:13:07,076
