267
00:15:36,896 --> 00:15:38,096
We've got to give this our all.

268
00:15:38,316 --> 00:15:39,116
Yeah, you're right.

269
00:15:39,276 --> 00:15:40,016
Keep going.

270
00:15:40,016 --> 00:15:43,116
In any case, she must be really hungry.

271
00:15:43,556 --> 00:15:45,956
She's still a growing girl, right?

272
00:15:46,196 --> 00:15:46,856
I guess.

273
00:15:53,436 --> 00:15:54,456
It's no use.

274
00:15:54,816 --> 00:15:55,916
None of the stores are open.

275
00:15:56,036 --> 00:15:57,196
Everyone's evacuated.

276
00:15:57,516 --> 00:15:58,236
Hey, wait a minute.

277
00:15:58,556 --> 00:16:01,056
What about the kitchen back at the train station?

278
00:16:01,056 --> 00:16:02,516
No way.

279
00:16:02,856 --> 00:16:03,596
Think about it.

280
00:16:03,816 --> 00:16:05,716
The back streets are probably already flooded.

281
00:16:05,896 --> 00:16:08,616
Then we've got no choice but to keep looking around here.

282
00:16:08,816 --> 00:16:09,136
But...

283
00:16:09,136 --> 00:16:09,916
Let's get moving.

284
00:16:10,276 --> 00:16:13,016
What do you think will happen if we show up empty-handed?

285
00:16:13,016 --> 00:16:28,856
Oh, rain.

286
00:16:29,896 --> 00:16:31,076
This is bad.

287
00:16:31,576 --> 00:16:34,456
The strong winds are already interfering with my sense of smell.

288
00:16:34,456 --> 00:16:34,876
Oh, rain.

289
00:21:55,180 --> 00:22:12,180
夢見た僕らは間違いじゃないと信じて 荒く埋れる海原を渡って行ける

290
00:22:12,180 --> 00:22:22,180
誰よりも勇敢で思いやりもあるけれど

291
00:22:22,180 --> 00:22:32,180
もしも君がこの船を降りて 違う世界にいたとしても

292
00:22:32,180 --> 00:22:40,180
最後にはきっと笑えるよ

293
00:22:40,180 --> 00:22:50,180
次回予告

294
00:22:50,180 --> 00:22:52,180
Luffy! Luffy! Luffy!

295
00:22:52,180 --> 00:22:57,180
Hey Nami! I kinda got stuck here when that leopard guy sent me flying

296
00:22:57,180 --> 00:22:59,180
Listen! Robin was lying to us!

297
00:22:59,180 --> 00:23:00,180
She was?

298
00:23:00,180 --> 00:23:01,180
About what?

299
00:23:01,180 --> 00:23:03,180
She's sacrificing herself in order to protect us!

300
00:23:03,180 --> 00:23:06,180
Then let's get going! We gotta protect her!

301
00:23:06,180 --> 00:23:12,180
On the next, One Piece! Nami's soul cries out! Straw Hat Luffy makes a comeback!

302
00:23:12,180 --> 00:23:14,180
I'm gonna be king of the pirates!

